<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE- Singatronics H1 net up to S$2.3 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Singatronics H1 net up to S$2.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.29  vs  2.24 (loss)</p>
<p>Group shr (cents)		   94.00  vs 92.00 (loss)</p>
<p>    Turnover				23.65  vs 15.99</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.88  vs  2.58</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   2.14  vs  1.73</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation    1.58  vs  2.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 3.18  vs  1.69</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	    0.31  vs  0.30</p>
<p>    Tax					0.61  vs  0.25</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (loss) 0.59  vs  0.59 (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     (gain) 0.04  vs  1.11 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Singatronics Ltd said a 48 percent in turnover and positive contributions from its Malaysian manufacturing unit and its hotel/properties division all contributed to the company's first half return to profit.</p>
